  "description": {
    "text": "The White Kyurem-EX deck of the second Battle Strength Deck 60 pair, two ready-built 60-card decks released together on 19 October 2012, a year after the Reshiram-EX and Zekrom-EX decks. Each is led by its own Kyurem-EX, a different card from those of the Freeze Bolt and Cold Flare expansions, and also holds a Team Plasma Pokémon-EX, here Moltres-EX, with strong Trainer cards such as Professor Juniper, Pokémon Catcher and Ultra Ball. A playmat, a coin, damage counters and markers and a strategy guide for its Kyurem came with it.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ポケモンカードゲームBW　バトル強化デッキ60「ブラックキュレムEX」「ホワイトキュレムEX」",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20120923001158/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/bw/bkwk.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
        "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9D%E3%82%B1%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7"
